# ============================================
#  WHITELIST MODEL — everything is ignored
#  unless explicitly allowed below.
#
#  If it is not the published word of the
#  Meridian AI Standard, it does not belong here.
# ============================================

# Ignore everything by default
*

# ============================================
#  ALLOWED: The published Meridian AI Standard
# ============================================

# Repo infrastructure
!.gitignore
!README.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!LICENSE

# The canonical generalized MERIDIAN.md (single source of truth) plus the distilled companion
# and the operational practice file (the third tool of the Implementation depth ladder).
!MERIDIAN.md
!MERIDIAN.distilled.md
!MERIDIAN.implementation.md

# Root surfaces: constitutional document, MERIDIAN.md adoption pages, Implementation
# depth-ladder pages, changelog. meridian-md-template.mdx is retained as an inert
# legacy file (page route removed; inbound /meridian-md-template traffic 308-redirects
# to /meridian-md per next.config.ts).
!meridian-ai-standard.mdx
!meridian-md.mdx
!meridian-md-template.mdx
!implementation.mdx
!meridian-md-distilled.mdx
!meridian-implementation.mdx
!changelog.mdx

# The Audit (method page and audit records). Probe methodology lives inside
# audit/audit.mdx as Layer I internal methodology under v0.1.1; the standalone
# probes/ directory and probes-implementation.mdx were retired 2026-05-10 per
# the v5.0 follow-up coherence pass and are no longer whitelisted.
!audit/
!audit/*.mdx

# The Case Record (landing and cases)
!cases/
!cases/*.mdx
